<p>Enhances your Deadly Poison with a volatile agent, causing the poison to deal <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>Vile Poisons talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">18%, 28%, 35%, 40%, 44%</acronym> increased damage to the victim and damage all of your enemies adjacent to it for 50%.</p>